      <h1 class="guide-article__title">Your Complete Guide to Libersens: From First Charge to Everyday Care</h1>
      <p class="guide-article__subtitle">Everything you need to know to start confidently, care properly, and make the most of your Libersens product — without any guesswork.</p>
