      <section class="guide-article__section">
        <h2>Troubleshooting Common Questions</h2>

        <h3>My product won't turn on</h3>
        <p>Charge it for at least 30 minutes and try again. If the LED indicator doesn't show any light during charging, try the other orientation of the magnetic cable. If the problem persists, contact hello@libersens.com with your order number.</p>

        <h3>The intensity seems lower than expected</h3>
        <p>This usually means the battery needs a full charge. Run a complete charge cycle and test again. If you've been using the product on high settings for extended periods, the battery may benefit from a full discharge and recharge cycle.</p>

        <h3>The silicone surface feels tacky</h3>
        <p>This can happen if the product was stored slightly damp, or came into contact with an incompatible material. Clean the surface with warm water and a small amount of cornstarch, rinse thoroughly, and dry completely. The surface should return to its natural smooth feel.</p>

        <h3>I have a question that isn't answered here</h3>
        <p>Email hello@libersens.com. All support is handled privately and discreetly. We're available Monday to Friday, 10:00 to 18:00, and aim to respond within one business day.</p>
      </section>

